        ('A patient with "acute onset" of "flank pain" and "hematuria" is a "horses" case for:', '["Renal failure", "Nephrolithiasis (Kidney stone)", "Bladder cancer", "UTI"]'::jsonb, 1, 'Sudden, severe, colicky flank pain is the hallmark of stones.'),
