        ('A patient with "fever," "headache," and "nuchal rigidity" (stiff neck) has:', '["Meningitis", "Tension headache", "Migraine", "Encephalitis"]'::jsonb, 0, 'The classic triad for meningeal inflammation.'),
        ('According to the "On Call" approach, a patient with "tachycardia" and "shortness of breath" should first have their _____ checked:', '["Hemoglobin", "Oxygen Saturation and Heart Rate (ABCs)", "Potassium", "Chest X-ray"]'::jsonb, 1, 'Always start with the ABCs and vital signs.'),
